      <p>Arditi, A., Obeso, O., Syed, A., Paleka, D., Panickssery, N., Gurnee, W. &amp; Nanda, N. (2024). <a href="{{ exp.paper_url }}"><em>{{ exp.paper_title }}</em></a>. NeurIPS 2024.</p>
      <p>Answers judged with {{ exp.judge }} (Qwen team, 2025). Prompts from the public benchmarks listed above, used under their respective licences.</p>
